9. {d}a-nun-na al#-hul2#-hul2-le-ne 
#tr.en: The Anunua were rejoicing 
10. e2 {d}gesztin#-an-na-kam {gesz}al-gar-sur9-ra-am3 
#tr.en: In(!?) the temple of Geštinanna, the algarsur instrument is (there?) 
