30. gesz hur-sag-ga2 {gesz}al-la-nu-um-ma 
#tr.en: The tree of the mountain range is the oak tree 
31. szim hur-sag-ga2 {gesz}ar-ga-nu-um-ma 
#tr.en: The aromatic of the mountain range is (of the) arganum tree 
